  "body": "Here is your chance to create a home that truly suits the way you want to live, in a location where the coast is part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nStart the day with coffee close to home, spend the afternoon by the beach, or take care of the essentials at the nearby Coast Shopping Centre. Everything you need is within easy reach, while the neighbourhood still offers the relaxed atmosphere that makes coastal living so appealing.\r\n\r\nConnectivity is set to become even better with O Mahurangi - Penlink nearing completion, providing a new link to the wider Auckland network and making this an increasingly well-connected place to call home.\r\n\r\nWith titles already issued and services in place, these sections are ready for the next step. Choose the site that works for you, explore your building options and start turning your ideas into a home of your own.\r\n\r\nWell-located land with this combination of lifestyle and future connectivity is not easy to find. Whether you are ready to build now or planning ahead, this is an opportunity worth considering.\r\n\r\nChoose your section. Create your home. Make the coast your own.\r\n\r\nContact Jimmy on 021 659 668 today for pricing, current section availability and builder terms.",
